<h1>Accessibility statement</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings wants the Meridian Portal to be usable by staff and partners regardless of ability. This site is designed to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 at level AA, including keyboard navigation, clear heading structure, and text that resizes without loss of content.</p>

<p>We know some older documents linked from the newsroom and supplier pages predate this standard and may not be fully accessible. We are working through these on a rolling basis as they are updated. If you use assistive technology and find a page that does not work as expected, please tell us which page and what happened.</p>

<p>Accessibility issues can be reported through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. We aim to acknowledge reports within five working days. For general information about the site's structure, see our <a href="/sitemap">site map</a>.</p>
